  "Select Object\n": "选择对象\n",
  "This is a Passive Skill which progresses while you play the game.": "这是被动技能，会在你游玩时持续推进。",
  "Grow Crops": "种植作物",
  "Purchase Farming Plots and plant Seeds to grow various types of Crops.": "购买种植地块，播下种子，种植各种作物。",
  "Crop Care": "作物养护",
  "Protect Crops from Pests and Disease, and keep them Watered to maximise their rewards.": "保护作物免受害虫与疾病侵袭，并及时浇水，以获得最多奖励。",
  "Crop Types": "作物类型",
  "Grow Allotments for Cooking, Herbs for Herblore, Trees for Skill XP, and Orchard Trees for Fruit.": "在菜地种植烹饪食材，种植草药供草药学使用，种树获取技能经验，种植果树获取水果。",
  "Composting": "堆肥",
  "Use Compost Bins to create Compost, which can be applied to Crops to increase their output.": "使用堆肥箱制作堆肥，再施用于作物以提高产量。",
  "Use the Grain Mill to produce Grain for Ranching, and Flour and Sugar for Cooking.": "使用谷物磨坊生产牧场所需的谷物，以及烹饪所需的面粉和糖。",
  "Farming Automation": "种植自动化",
  "Automate Planting, Harvesting, Watering and Composting to manage your Crops automatically.\n\nAutomation consumes Wine to operate.": "自动执行播种、收获、浇水与施肥，自动管理作物。\n\n自动化运行需要消耗葡萄酒。",
  "Select Asset": "选择资源",
  "Costs & Requirements": "费用与条件",
  "Hold to Buy": "按住以购买",
  "Purchased": "已购买",
  "Buy limit:": "购买上限：",
  "Animal Name": "动物名称",
  "Trap Type:": "陷阱类型：",
  "Traps": "陷阱",
  "[b]Traps[/b] are required to hunt an Animal. Different Animals require different types of [b]Traps[/b].\n\n[b]Traps[/b] can be created in [img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Icons/Crafting.png[/img][b]Crafting[/b].": "狩猎动物需要[b]陷阱[/b]。不同动物需要不同类型的[b]陷阱[/b]。\n\n[b]陷阱[/b]可通过[img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Icons/Crafting.png[/img][b]制作[/b]技能制作。",
  "Tool:": "工具：",
  "[b]Hunting Tools[/b] are used automatically during the Hunting process.\n\nBonuses can be applied to specific [b]Hunting Tools[/b] via the [img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Icons/Shop_64.png[/img] [b]Shop[/b] and other means.\n\nSome animals do not use [b]Hunting Tools[/b].": "[b]狩猎工具[/b]会在狩猎过程中自动使用。\n\n可通过[img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Icons/Shop_64.png[/img] [b]商店[/b]等途径，为特定[b]狩猎工具[/b]增加加成。\n\n某些动物不需要使用[b]狩猎工具[/b]。",
  "Task Categories": "任务类别",
  "Hide Locked": "隐藏未解锁项",
  "Deselect": "取消选择",
  "Name": "名称",
  "Item Name Item Name Item Name": "物品名称 物品名称 物品名称",
  "Stance": "架势",
  "Interrupts turn when applied": "施加时打断回合",
  "While Applied:": "生效期间：",
  "Toggle Mute for Music": "切换音乐静音",
  "Skip Track": "切换下一曲",
  "Upgrade Item": "升级物品",
  "Select Upgrade": "选择升级",
  "Final cost:": "最终费用：",
  "Hold to Upgrade": "按住以升级",
  "Input": "投入",
  "Darkness:": "黑暗：",
  "Your [b]Accuracy Rating[/b] & [b]Evasion Rating[/b] is reduced by [b][color=orange]5%[/color][/b] per your [b]Light[/b] value below the [b]Darkness[/b] value.": "你的[b]光照[/b]值每低于[b]黑暗[/b]值 1 点，[b]命中等级[/b]与[b]闪避等级[/b]便降低[b][color=orange]5%[/color][/b]。",
  "Requirements": "条件",
  "No requirements": "无条件",
  "0 in Bank": "银行中有 0",
  "{0:N0} in Bank": "银行中有 {0:N0}",
  "Damaged for: ": "受到伤害：",
  "For each Stack:": "每层：",
  "Lasts until the end of the fight": "持续至战斗结束",
  "Protections": "防护",
  "Pests:": "害虫：",
  "Pest Maintenance": "害虫防治",
  "Your Pest Protection / Product's Pest Attraction.\n- Reduces final product quantity if not maintained.\n- This can be maintained while the product is growing.": "你的害虫防护值／作物的害虫吸引值。\n- 若不加以控制，会降低最终产物数量。\n- 可在作物生长期间进行防治。",
  "Disease:": "疾病：",
  "Disease Maintenance": "疾病防治",
  "Your Disease Protection / Product's Disease Attraction.\n- Reduces final product quantity if not maintained.\n- This can be maintained while the product is growing.": "你的疾病防护值／作物的疾病吸引值。\n- 若不加以控制，会降低最终产物数量。\n- 可在作物生长期间进行防治。",
  "Product Quantity Adjustment": "产物数量调整",
  "The final adjustment to your product quantity based on\nPests & Disease Maintenance.\nOnly applied when product is [b]fully grown[/b], after all other bonuses.": "根据害虫与疾病防治情况，\n对产物数量进行最终调整。\n仅在作物[b]完全长成[/b]时生效，于所有其他加成之后计算。",
  "Testy Mc Test Face": "Testy Mc Test Face",
  "Woodcutting Statistics": "伐木统计",
  "0 stack(s) left.": "剩余 0 层。",
  "{0:N0} stack(s) left.": "剩余 {0:N0} 层。",
  "1 stack removed per Cut.": "每次砍倒移除 1 层。",
  "View All Milestones": "查看所有里程碑",
  "Empty": "空",
  "What is Hunting?": "什么是狩猎？",
  "Hunting is a Skill that tasks you to hunt a variety of wild Animals & Beasts in order to acquire their rewards.\n\nHunting feeds directly into [b]Beastcrafting[/b] as its primary use, while also rewarding you with various other Items such as [b]Herb Seeds[/b] and [b]Bones[/b]": "狩猎是一项通过猎取各种野生动物与野兽来获取奖励的技能。\n\n狩猎主要为[b]驭兽工艺[/b]提供材料，同时还会奖励[b]草药种子[/b]、[b]骨头[/b]等各种物品",
  "What do I do?": "该怎么做？",
  "Before you can hunt, you must craft a Trap in Crafting.\n\nEach Animal requires a specific Trap, which is listed in Hunting when you select the Animal.\n\nYou can then hunt the Animal, which is an automatic 3-step process, rewarding you with Skill XP and Items upon successfully trapping the Animal.": "开始狩猎前，你必须先通过制作技能制作陷阱。\n\n每种动物都需要特定陷阱。在狩猎界面中选择动物时，可以查看所需陷阱。\n\n之后就可以狩猎该动物。狩猎是一个自动进行的三步流程，成功诱捕动物后，你将获得技能经验与物品。",
  "The automatic 3-step Hunting process": "自动进行的狩猎三步流程",
  "[img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/AnimalHusbandry/happiness.png[/img] [b]Happiness[/b] is calculated as the average of these 3 substats:": "[img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/AnimalHusbandry/happiness.png[/img] [b]幸福度[/b]取以下三项属性的平均值：",
  "Hunger": "饱食度",
  "[ul]Keep your Animals fed every hour.\nLose 10% every hour an Animal is not fed.\nReplenish to 100% when fed.[/ul]": "[ul]每小时喂食动物。\n每小时未喂食会损失 10%。\n喂食后恢复至 100%。[/ul]",
  "Comfort": "舒适度",
  "[ul]Keep Enclosures repaired as they degrade by 1% every hour.\nThis does not affect Animal's Happiness until it falls below 75%.[/ul]": "[ul]及时修复围栏，围栏每小时损耗 1%。\n舒适度低于 75% 后才会影响动物幸福度。[/ul]",
  "Satisfaction": "满足感",
  "[ul]Animals have unique needs that can be met to boost Satisfaction.\nManaging this allows Happiness to increase above 100%.[/ul]": "[ul]动物各有独特需求，满足这些需求可提升满足感。\n管理此属性可使幸福度超过 100%。[/ul]",
  "[color=green]Begin the Skill by purchasing your first plot of [b][color=white]Land[/color][/b] and building an [b][color=white]Enclosure[/color][/b].[/color]": "[color=green]购买第一块[b][color=white]土地[/color][/b]并建造[b][color=white]围栏[/color][/b]，开始训练此技能。[/color]",
  "Base Cost:": "基础消耗：",
  "10 [img height=1.25em]res://icon.svg[/img] Prayer Points": "10 [img height=1.25em]res://icon.svg[/img] 祈祷点数",
  "Current Cost with Modifiers:": "应用修正后的当前消耗：",
  "Item Opened": "物品已开启",
  "Please wait while we rig the results...": "请稍候，我们正在暗箱操作结果……",
  "Opening stopped due to insufficient inventory space. Clear space and open again to receive the Item.": "因物品栏空间不足而停止开启。清出空间后再次开启，即可获得物品。",
  "Difficulty: ": "难度：",
  "Magic & Elements": "魔法与元素",
  "Fight Enemies": "与敌人战斗",
  "Battle enemies to gain [color=#FFD16D]Combat Skill XP[/color] and collect valuable rewards as loot. [color=#FFD16D]Combat Skill XP[/color] is granted based on the [color=#FFD16D]weapon damage[/color] you deal.": "与敌人战斗，获取[color=#FFD16D]战斗技能经验[/color]及珍贵战利品。[color=#FFD16D]战斗技能经验[/color]根据你造成的[color=#FFD16D]武器伤害[/color]发放。",
  "Choose a Combat Area": "选择战斗区域",
  "Select from [color=#FFD16D]Combat Areas, Slayer Zones[/color] or [color=#FFD16D]Dungeons[/color] to find different enemies to battle.": "在[color=#FFD16D]战斗区域、屠杀区域[/color]或[color=#FFD16D]地牢[/color]中寻找不同敌人进行战斗。",
  "Automatic Healing via Auto Eat": "通过自动进食恢复生命",
  "[color=#FFD16D]Equip [u]Food[/u][/color] to automatically restore Health when it falls below a set threshold, helping you survive longer battles.\n\nMore information is contained by hovering over the [color=#FFD16D]Auto Eat icon on your Health Bar[/color].": "[color=#FFD16D]装备[u]食物[/u][/color]后，生命值低于设定阈值时会自动恢复，帮助你在长时间战斗中生存。\n\n将鼠标悬停在[color=#FFD16D]生命条上的自动进食图标[/color]上，可查看详细信息。",
  "Combat Styles": "战斗风格",
  "There are three Combat Styles: [color=#FFD16D]Melee, Ranged[/color] and [color=#FFD16D]Magic[/color]. Your equipped [color=#FFD16D]weapon[/color] determines which style you use.\n\n[color=#FFD16D]Melee[/color] beats [color=#FFD16D]Ranged[/color]\n[color=#FFD16D]Ranged[/color] beats [color=#FFD16D]Magic[/color]\n[color=#FFD16D]Magic[/color] beats [color=#FFD16D]Melee[/color]\n\nBeating a Combat Style [color=green]increases your Max Hit by 10%[/color], while losing [color=orange_red]decreases it by 10%[/color]. This is only applied to you, and never the Enemy.": "战斗风格分为三种：[color=#FFD16D]近战、远程[/color]和[color=#FFD16D]魔法[/color]。你装备的[color=#FFD16D]武器[/color]决定所使用的风格。\n\n[color=#FFD16D]近战[/color]克制[color=#FFD16D]远程[/color]\n[color=#FFD16D]远程[/color]克制[color=#FFD16D]魔法[/color]\n[color=#FFD16D]魔法[/color]克制[color=#FFD16D]近战[/color]\n\n克制对手的战斗风格时，[color=green]最大伤害提高 10%[/color]；被克制时，[color=orange_red]最大伤害降低 10%[/color]。此规则仅作用于你，不作用于敌人。",
  "Ranged required Ammunition": "远程需要弹药",
  "Using the [color=#FFD16D]Ranged Combat Style[/color] requires a [color=#FFD16D]Ranged Weapon[/color] plus its [color=#FFD16D]ammunition[/color]. For example, using a [u]Bow[/u] requires [u]Arrows[/u] as ammunition primarily obtained from Fletching.\n\nSome [color=#FFD16D]Ranged Weapons[/color] like [u]Javelins[/u] can be their own [color=#FFD16D]ammunition[/color].": "使用[color=#FFD16D]远程战斗风格[/color]需要[color=#FFD16D]远程武器[/color]及其对应的[color=#FFD16D]弹药[/color]。例如，[u]弓[/u]需要使用主要由制箭技能制作的[u]箭[/u]作为弹药。\n\n某些[color=#FFD16D]远程武器[/color]，例如[u]标枪[/u]，本身就可作为[color=#FFD16D]弹药[/color]。",
  "Magic requires Runes": "魔法需要符文",
  "The [color=#FFD16D]Magic Combat Style[/color] requires a [color=#FFD16D]Magic Weapon[/color] in combination with the the use of [color=aqua]Magic Spells[/color]. These cost [u]Runes[/u] primarily obtained from Runecrafting.": "[color=#FFD16D]魔法战斗风格[/color]需要将[color=#FFD16D]魔法武器[/color]与[color=aqua]魔法法术[/color]搭配使用。施法会消耗主要由符文制作技能产出的[u]符文[/u]。",
  "Combat Stances": "战斗架势",
  "Each weapon has different [color=#FFD16D]Stances[/color] to choose from. Your selected [color=#FFD16D]Stance[/color] determines which Combat Skills gain XP.": "每种武器都有不同的[color=#FFD16D]架势[/color]可供选择。所选[color=#FFD16D]架势[/color]决定哪些战斗技能获得经验。",
  "Weapon choice matters": "武器选择很重要",
  "The [color=#FFD16D]weapon[/color] you use determines the [color=#FFD16D]Stances[/color] available to choose from. Not all [color=#FFD16D]weapons[/color] have access to all [color=#FFD16D]Stances[/color].": "所用[color=#FFD16D]武器[/color]决定可选择的[color=#FFD16D]架势[/color]。并非所有[color=#FFD16D]武器[/color]都能使用全部[color=#FFD16D]架势[/color]。",
  "Take a look at the [color=#FFD16D]Equipment Stats[/color] tab to see how this is calculated in relation to your [color=#FFD16D]Stance[/color].": "查看[color=#FFD16D]装备属性[/color]标签页，了解这些数值如何根据你的[color=#FFD16D]架势[/color]计算。",
  "Equipment Stats": "装备属性",
  "Accuracy & Evasion": "命中与闪避",
  "Your [color=#FFD16D]chance to hit[/color] depends on your [color=#FFD16D]Stance's Accuracy[/color] compared to the [color=#FFD16D]Enemy's Evasion[/color] against that same [color=#FFD16D]Stance[/color].\n\nWhen fighting an Enemy, aim to have a higher [color=#FFD16D]Accuracy Rating[/color] than their [color=#FFD16D]Evasion Rating[/color].": "你的[color=#FFD16D]命中几率[/color]取决于[color=#FFD16D]当前架势的命中[/color]与[color=#FFD16D]敌人对同一架势的闪避[/color]之间的比较，该[color=#FFD16D]架势[/color]决定对应属性。\n\n与敌人战斗时，尽量使你的[color=#FFD16D]命中等级[/color]高于对方的[color=#FFD16D]闪避等级[/color]。",
  "Power & Protection": "威力与防护",
  "Damage from attacks is reduced by a percentage depending on [color=#FFD16D]Power[/color] and [color=#FFD16D]Protection[/color].\n\nYour [color=#FFD16D]Power[/color] compared to the [color=#FFD16D]Enemy's Protection[/color] determines how much of your damage is reduced. Higher [color=#FFD16D]Power[/color] helps overcome enemy [color=#FFD16D]Protection[/color].\n\n[color=#FFD16D]Power[/color] is primarily obtained from [color=#FFD16D]weapons[/color].\n[color=#FFD16D]Protection[/color] is primarily obtained from other gear.\n\nYou can reduce an Enemy's damage dealt to you by increasing your [color=#FFD16D]Protection[/color].": "攻击伤害会根据[color=#FFD16D]威力[/color]与[color=#FFD16D]防护[/color]按一定百分比降低。\n\n你的[color=#FFD16D]威力[/color]与[color=#FFD16D]敌人防护[/color]的对比决定伤害被降低的程度。较高的[color=#FFD16D]威力[/color]有助于突破敌人的[color=#FFD16D]防护[/color]。\n\n[color=#FFD16D]威力[/color]主要来自[color=#FFD16D]武器[/color]。\n[color=#FFD16D]防护[/color]主要来自其他装备。\n\n提高[color=#FFD16D]防护[/color]可降低敌人对你造成的伤害。",
  "Magic Elements": "魔法元素",
  "[color=#FFD16D]Magic Weapons[/color] have [color=#FFD16D]Elements[/color] attached to them which determine what type of [color=aqua]Magic Spells[/color] you can use in Combat.\n\nMonsters may also have an [color=#FFD16D]Element[/color], which can either buff or debuff your character.\n\nBeating an Element grants you with [color=green]+15% Max Hit[/color].\nLosing to an Element debuffs you with [color=orange_red]-15% Max Hit[/color].\n\nThis is only applied to you, and never to the Enemy.": "[color=#FFD16D]魔法武器[/color]带有[color=#FFD16D]元素[/color]，决定你在战斗中能使用哪些[color=aqua]魔法法术[/color]。\n\n怪物也可能带有[color=#FFD16D]元素[/color]，这可能使你的角色获得加成或减益。\n\n克制对方元素时，[color=green]最大伤害 +15%[/color]。\n被对方元素克制时，[color=orange_red]最大伤害 -15%[/color]。\n\n此规则仅作用于你，不作用于敌人。",
  "Air:\n[ul]Beats Earth\nLoses to Fire[/ul]": "风：\n[ul]克制地\n被火克制[/ul]",
  "Water:\n[ul]Beats Fire\nLoses to Earth[/ul]": "水：\n[ul]克制火\n被地克制[/ul]",
  "Earth:\n[ul]Beats Water\nLoses to Air[/ul]": "地：\n[ul]克制水\n被风克制[/ul]",
  "Fire:\n[ul]Beats Air\nLoses to Water[/ul]": "火：\n[ul]克制风\n被水克制[/ul]",
  "Neutral has no effect.": "中立元素无影响。",
  "Using Prayers": "使用祈祷",
  "[color=#FFD16D]Prayers[/color] are toggleable passive effects that can buff your Character. These cost [color=#FFD16D]Prayer Points[/color] to remain active.": "[color=#FFD16D]祈祷[/color]是可开关的被动效果，能强化角色。保持激活需要消耗[color=#FFD16D]祈祷点数[/color]。",
  "Obtaining Prayer Points": "获取祈祷点数",
  "[color=#FFD16D]Prayer Points[/color] are obtained by buring [u]Bones[/u] dropped from slain Enemies (via your Bank), or through other methods such as Firemaking.": "[color=#FFD16D]祈祷点数[/color]可通过在银行中埋葬敌人掉落的[u]骨头[/u]获得，也可通过生火等其他方式获取。",
  "Prayer XP": "祈祷经验",
  "[color=#FFD16D]Prayer XP[/color] is gained while actively using [color=#FFD16D]Prayers[/color]. Your damage dealt and cost of the Prayer determines the XP gained, with higher cost Prayers providing more XP per damage.": "激活[color=#FFD16D]祈祷[/color]时可获得[color=#FFD16D]祈祷经验[/color]。经验取决于造成的伤害与祈祷消耗；消耗越高的祈祷，每点伤害提供的经验越多。",
  "Preparing": "准备",
  "Heating": "加热",
  "Stirring": "搅拌",
  "Bottling": "装瓶",
  "0 Remaining": "剩余 0",
  "{0:N0} Remaining": "剩余 {0:N0}",
  "Inputs consumed & rewards granted per Bottling step.": "每次装瓶步骤消耗材料并发放奖励。",
  "Cook Food": "烹饪食物",
  "Cook various types of Food to restore Health when consumed. Some Food also provides special bonuses when used.": "烹饪各种食物，食用后可恢复生命。有些食物还会提供特殊加成。",
  "Cooking Success Chance": "烹饪成功率",
  "Your chance to successfully cook Food depends on your Cooking Proficiency compared to the Food's Difficulty.\n\nCooking Proficiency can be increased by leveling Cooking, equipping Items, or via the Shop or other Skills.": "烹饪成功率取决于烹饪熟练度与食物难度的比较。\n\n提升烹饪等级、装备物品，或通过商店和其他技能，都能提高烹饪熟练度。",
  "Create Bait": "制作诱饵",
  "Use Cooking to create Bait that helps with Fishing and Hunting.": "通过烹饪制作诱饵，辅助钓鱼与狩猎。",
  "Hunt Animals": "狩猎动物",
  "Hunt various animals to collect rewards. Each animal requires a specific type of Trap, created through Crafting.": "狩猎各种动物以获得奖励。每种动物都需要特定类型的陷阱，可通过制作技能制造。",
  "The Hunting Process": "狩猎流程",
  "Hunting is automatic and involves three stages: Surveying an area, Tracking an animal, and attempting to Trap it.\n\nIf trapping fails, the animal flees and must be tracked again.": "狩猎自动进行，包含三个阶段：勘察区域、追踪动物、尝试诱捕。\n\n诱捕失败时，动物会逃跑，必须重新追踪。",
  "Animal Levels": "动物等级",
